WEBVTT

00:07:57.392 --> 00:08:00.366
“Ahhhh”, moi ben.

00:08:00.390 --> 00:08:02.108
Agora imos quentar os beizos,

00:08:02.132 --> 00:08:04.460
e imos dicir “ba, ba, ba, ba,

00:08:04.484 --> 00:08:07.412
ba, ba, ba, ba”. Moi ben.

00:08:07.436 --> 00:08:10.852
E agora, “brrrrrrrrr”,

00:08:10.876 --> 00:08:12.402
coma se fosen rapaces.

00:08:12.426 --> 00:08:14.829
“Brrrr”. Agora os beizos
terían que estar vivos.

00:08:14.853 --> 00:08:16.504
De seguido, imos facer a lingua

00:08:16.528 --> 00:08:20.826
cun exaxerado “la, la, la,
la, la, la, la, la, la”.

00:08:20.850 --> 00:08:23.041
Marabilloso. Vostedes xa son
moi bos nisto.

00:08:23.065 --> 00:08:25.931
E logo, enrolen un erre: “rrrrrrrrr”.

00:08:25.955 --> 00:08:28.147
Iso é coma champaña para a lingua.

00:08:28.171 --> 00:08:30.467
Finalmente, se podo facer ao menos un,